# 🎫 EventEdge — Event Management & Booking Website

EventEdge is a modern, responsive **Event Management and Booking Website** built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. It allows users to discover upcoming events, explore event categories, save favorite events, register for events, and create their own events.

The website provides an attractive interface with responsive layouts, dark/light mode, interactive forms, event filtering, favorites, and browser-based data storage.

---

## 🌟 Features

### 🏠 Home Page

* Attractive hero section
* Featured events
* Popular event categories
* Event discovery section
* Responsive navigation
* Call-to-action buttons

### 🎟️ Events

* Browse available events
* Event cards with:

  * Event title
  * Category
  * Date and time
  * Location
  * Ticket price
  * Event image
* Search and filtering functionality
* Event details access

### 📋 Event Details

* Detailed event information
