### 🎫 Event Registration

Users can register for events by providing:

* Full name
* Email address
* Phone number
* Number of tickets
* Payment method
* Discount code
* Special requests
* Terms and conditions confirmation

The system calculates the total ticket cost and generates a confirmation ID after successful registration.

### ➕ Create an Event

Event organizers can create new events by entering:

* Event title
* Category
* Organizer name
* Date
* Time
* Location
* Ticket price
* Capacity
* Cover image keyword
* Event description

Created events are saved locally and displayed on the website.

