## 💾 Data Storage

EventEdge currently uses **browser Local Storage** instead of a backend database.

This allows the website to remember information even after refreshing the page.

Stored information can include:

```text
Favorites
Registrations
Created Events
Login Information
Theme Preference
```

> Since Local Storage is browser-based, the data is specific to the browser/device being used.

